    "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/queensblade/images/f/f2/Karin_Red_Sky%27s_Medium_Queen%27s_Blade_Unlimited_Limit_Break_.jpg/revision/latest?cb=20260106133543\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"Karin Red Sky&#39;s Medium Queen&#39;s Blade Unlimited Limit Break \" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/queensblade/images/f/f2/Karin_Red_Sky%27s_Medium_Queen%27s_Blade_Unlimited_Limit_Break_.jpg/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/400?cb=20260106133543\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"400\" height=\"968\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-image-name=\"Karin Red Sky&#39;s Medium Queen&#39;s Blade Unlimited Limit Break .jpg\" data-image-key=\"Karin_Red_Sky%27s_Medium_Queen%27s_Blade_Unlimited_Limit_Break_.jpg\" data-relevant=\"1\" /></a></span>\n</p><p><b>红天的媒介</b>\n</p><p>她是一位来自遥远村庄的女祭司，保护村庄免受魔兽和邪灵的侵害。她使用的遗物能储存夕阳的能量，并将其转化为魔力。\n\n</p>\n<div id=\"gallery-0\" hash=\"f6bfd105b5c889820f97e00c72f3aad6\" data-seq-no=\"0\" class=\"wikia-gallery wikia-gallery-caption-below wikia-gallery-position-left wikia-gallery-spacing-medium wikia-gallery-border-small wikia-gallery-captions-left wikia-gallery-caption-size-medium\"><div class=\"wikia-gallery-caption\"></div><div class=\"wikia-gallery-item\" style=\"width:187px; \"><div class=\"thumb\" style=\"height:187px;\"><div class=\"gallery-image-wrapper accent\" id=\"Karin_RSM_Crimson_Firebird_Queen-s_Blade_Unlimited_Limit_Break_-jpg\" style=\"position: relative; height:184px; width:90px; top:0.5px;\"><a class=\"image lightbox\" href=\"/wiki/File:Karin_RSM_Crimson_Firebird_Queen%27s_Blade_Unlimited_Limit_Break_.jpg\" title=\"Karin RSM Crimson Firebird Queen&#39;s Blade Unlimited Limit Break .jpg (255 KB)\" style=\"height:184px; width:90px;\"><noscript><img style=\"\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/queensblade/images/b/b8/Karin_RSM_Crimson_Firebird_Queen%27s_Blade_Unlimited_Limit_Brea